      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": "text_3",
      "quote": "\"Has the possible exposure to SARS-CoV-2 during the COVID-19 pandemic (I) affected the mental health (O) of HPs providing health care outside the hospital (P)?\"",
      "reason": "The review addresses observational exposure and mental health outcomes rather than effects of interventions; therefore describing an intervention mechanism is not applicable."
    },
