      "reason": "The manuscript reports the number of reviewers for title/abstract screening (three independent reviewers) and describes that full-text selection/data extraction were completed in pairs, with third-reviewer involvement on specific occasions."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_8_e2",
